       FFUUSSEE__SSTTAATTFFSS
              This  operation implements ssttaattffss(2) for this filesystem.  There
              is no input data associated with this request.  The expected re‐
              ply data has the following structure:

                  struct fuse_kstatfs {
                      uint64_t blocks;
                      uint64_t bfree;
                      uint64_t bavail;
                      uint64_t files;
                      uint64_t ffree;
                      uint32_t bsize;
                      uint32_t namelen;
                      uint32_t frsize;
                      uint32_t padding;
                      uint32_t spare[6];
                  };

                  struct fuse_statfs_out {
                      struct fuse_kstatfs st;
                  };

              For the interpretation of these fields, see ssttaattffss(2).

